.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":9,\"seasonName\":\"Season 9\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-09-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Details of Craftsmanship\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors begin their Details of Craftsmanship series to help you become a better woodworker. Then, learn how to apply plastic laminate as they build a must-have, table saw outfeed table. Finally, check out a top-notch mortising machine in the Pages in Action segment.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Top-Notch Chiseling to High-End Hardware\",\"overview\":\"Take your chiseling techniques to the next level as the Woodsmith editors show you how to clean out a through mortise. Plus, the Woodsmith editors complete a table saw outfeed table by adding the legs with a hinged assembly. And low-cost hardware gets a high-end look.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Perfect Tenons & Lumber Thickness\",\"overview\":\"In Details of Craftsmanship, a precision tenon is created for a through mortise. Then watch as the Woodsmith editors discuss the key tips and tricks for creating a rabbeted miter joint in an episode flashback. Finally, buy better lumber after you discover the secret to lumber sizing.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Smooth Curves, Slot-Cutters & Painting Hardware\",\"overview\":\"Create smooth curves and straight lines the easy way with time-tested tips. In Router Workshop, the editors of Woodsmith magazine discuss how to choose and get the most out of a hand-held router and a slot-cutting bit. And then the editors show a quick and easy way to change the look of ordinary hinges.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-10\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"In the Shop with Details of Craftsmanship\",\"overview\":\"Key techniques for building a Greene & Greene table are featured in Details of Craftsmanship. Then the Woodsmith editors work on building a new shop project that saves time, space, and money. Listen in as the editors talk shop about one of their favorite shop topics.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Tips, Tricks & Techniques\",\"overview\":\"Every segment provides the tips and tricks you need to know to build better projects, from handy assembly hints to using the right techniques. The Woodsmith editors show a handy way to secure workpieces without clamps.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Power Tool Essentials\",\"overview\":\"Join the Woodsmith editors as they focus on some must-know power tool techniques for creating perfect project parts, plus ways to work quickly and accurately every time. Once again, the editors talk shop to focus on getting better results every time you step into the shop.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-31\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Fundamentals of Woodworking\",\"overview\":\"No matter what you want to build, the Woodsmith editors show you the best solutions for gluing up a perfect panel.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-07\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Craftsmanship on Display\",\"overview\":\"In Details of Craftsmanship, the editors of Woodsmith magazine provide the shop-tested techniques for building a rock-solid drawer using the table saw.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Working Small\",\"overview\":\"Follow along with the Woodsmith editors as they go into the details of creating elegant drawer pulls for a hall table.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Panel Basics, Storage & More\",\"overview\":\"The challenges of storage are discussed by featuring tips and tricks for making the most of drawer interiors.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-28\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Details of Craftsmanship\",\"overview\":\"Watch the Woodsmith editors dress up a panel by adding breadboards ends and decorative plugs.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Details of Craftsmanship: Finishing\",\"overview\":\"The editors of Woodsmith magazine wrap up this season's Details of Craftsmanship by applying a finish to highlight the look of an elegant table.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-12\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}